sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Attacker
    participant LeakedDB as Leaked Database
    participant Service as Service

    Attacker->>LeakedDB: Query (user, pass)
    LeakedDB-->>Attacker: Return list of credentials

    loop For each credential pair
        Attacker->>Service: Login Request (user, pass)
        alt Login Success
            Service-->>Attacker: 200 OK / Session Token
            Attacker->>Attacker: Store Valid Account
        else Login Failed
            Service-->>Attacker: 401 Unauthorized
        end
    end
